(text "THREE LOW-VOLTAGE REGULATORS - EXTERNAL SEQUENCING REQUIRED" (at 17.78 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 2.1 2.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2f7dbca1-2778-580e-9dd8-b0d0525c341d"))
(text "TPS62901 replaces the TPS62160 study here: tighter regulation and adjustable ramp. Frozen ledger unchanged. CORE_5V required 4.85–5.15V." (at 17.78 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "127b87e0-82f1-506f-bb35-7757ccd2b1b5"))
(text "No PG-to-EN cascade. PG thresholds do not prove strict FPGA rail windows; PG is undefined below 1.8V VIN.\n6.8nF soft start models 2.231ms nominal; loaded ramp, input fault and restart sequencing remain unmeasured.\nVCC/PLL must precede VCCIO; FPGA reset and package supply/filter/decoupling connections are outside this block." (at 17.78 365.76 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "770a26a8-35dc-5070-a7b5-3755c594188a"))
(text "Discharge is conditional: requires a previous enable and input supply near 2V or above.\nNo guaranteed power-off discharge, latch-off, reverse-current blocking or machine permission.\nESP rail is separately regulated; independent upstream fault isolation is NOT implemented." (at 281.94 345.44 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9878eb08-0117-5af4-9ead-2788eca8a87c"))
)
